# Production image receives only declared runtime inputs. Private corpora, local
# environments, Git state, evaluation data, and backup material stay off the daemon.
**
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!requirements-prod.lock
!config/
!config/default_config.yaml
!config/knowledge_base_policies.yaml
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!src/
!src/**
!scripts/
!scripts/app_recovery.py
src/**/__pycache__/
src/**/*.pyc
